        "en": "Label: breastfeeding not recommended, or choose between the drug and breastfeeding."
      },
      "quote": "Because of the potential for serious adverse reactions in nursing infants from trifluoperazine, a decision should be made whether to discontinue nursing or to discontinue the drug, taking into account the importance of the drug to the mother.",
